  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chad MSME Development and Access to Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation will focus on three inter-linked objectives to: (i) improve the business enabling environment through digitalization, regulatory modernization and capacity building around the government-to-business interface; (ii) strengthen entrepreneurship, technology adoption and capabilities at growth-oriented MSMEs especially within sectors and value chains; and (iii) promote financial inclusion and MSME finance.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote growth and access to finance for micro, small and medium enterprises.</narrative>
  </description>
